---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | My Electronics Store">
  <div style="max-width:700px">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--muted)">Last updated: [date]</p>
    <p>This Privacy Policy explains how [Your Business Name] ("we", "us") collects, uses, and protects
      information when you use this website.</p>
    <h3>Information We Collect</h3>
    <p>When you place an order, we collect your name, email address, phone number, and delivery address.
      Payment details are processed directly by Razorpay and are not stored on our servers.</p>
    <h3>How We Use Your Information</h3>
    <p>We use this information to process and deliver your orders, communicate order updates, and
      respond to customer support requests. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>
    <h3>Data Sharing</h3>
    <p>We share order details with our payment gateway (Razorpay) and courier partners solely to
      complete your purchase and delivery.</p>
    <h3>Your Rights</h3>
    <p>You may contact us at your-email@example.com to request access to, correction of, or deletion
      of your personal information, subject to our legal obligations (such as retaining tax records).</p>
    <h3>Contact Us</h3>
    <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to your-email@example.com.</p>
  </div>
  <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;max-width:700px">
    (Store owner note: this is a generic starter template, not legal advice. Have it reviewed by a
    lawyer or your CA and fill in the bracketed details before relying on it.)
  </p>
</Layout>
